   "hLabel": 3606844771
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line31.6D03F",
   "szText": "But they’re spread thin. Adreona has staged the bulk of her forces in Temis. She was never one to play so conservatively.",
